          "canonical_hash": "sha256:6f6450e41f0564abab7dcf41d7b19a3d129e07a50c0be79a297b74fc7659ba20",
          "description": "Return today's arrival or departure board for an airport, optionally filtered by airline name. Returns airline, flight number, scheduled, estimated and actual times, terminals, gates and departure delay per flight. Covers the current day only: for any later date use future_flights_arrival_departure_schedule instead.",
