          "canonical_hash": "sha256:81a4ef31ecac2a5c763fad4c9cb47b8c7af1ca9c604f5f8e0df9ba203abc2cfe",
          "description": "Return live flights for one airline, optionally narrowed to a single flight status. Returns flight number, airline, departure and arrival airports with timezones, scheduled departure time, status, delay, terminal and gate. Use this to survey an airline's current activity; use get_flight_status when you already know the flight number.",
