          "description": "Return flights that already operated on a past date, with optional airline and route filters. Returns flight date, status, flight number, airline, and both airports with their scheduled times. Requires the Basic plan or higher. Use this for past dates only: use flight_arrival_departure_schedule for today and future_flights_arrival_departure_schedule for later dates.",
