          "description": "List airports from the reference catalog, one page at a time, with optional text search. Each record has airport name, IATA and ICAO codes, city IATA code, country name and ISO2, timezone and GMT offset, alongside a pagination block carrying limit, offset and total. Use search to resolve an airport name to the IATA code the flight tools expect.",
