          "canonical_hash": "sha256:10148de10203479570bf3bf9a58ae7b854a066baa3f4953f2d1bc2868928d094",
          "description": "List scheduled routes, one page at a time, filtered by any combination of airline, departure airport and arrival airport. Each record has airline IATA and ICAO codes, flight number, and departure and arrival airport codes, alongside a pagination block carrying limit, offset and total. This says which routes exist, not whether a flight is operating: use get_flight_status for that. Requires the Basic plan or higher.",
