          "description": "List aviation taxes from the reference catalog, one page at a time, with optional text search. Each record has tax id, tax name and the associated IATA code, alongside a pagination block carrying limit, offset and total. This is static reference data, not fares or amounts charged on a booking. Requires a paid plan.",
