          "canonical_hash": "sha256:28b9124b07b76a5d14fd0bb00033695b0a2aca6f0b891e278edbf202906e733c",
          "description": "Return a random sample of individual airplanes from the reference catalog. Each record has model name and code, series, production line, registration number, owner, age, engine type and count, delivery date and first flight date. Records are drawn from a random offset, so repeated calls return different aircraft. Sampling only: there is no lookup by registration.",
