          "description": "Return a random sample of cities from the reference catalog. Each record has city name, IATA code, country ISO2, latitude, longitude, timezone, GMT offset and geoname id. Records are drawn from a random offset, so repeated calls return different cities. Sampling only: there is no lookup by city name.",
