          "description": "Return a random sample of countries from the reference catalog. Each record has country name, capital, continent, ISO2, ISO3 and numeric ISO codes, FIPS code, currency name and code, phone prefix and population. Records are drawn from a random offset, so repeated calls return different countries. Sampling only: there is no lookup by country name or code.",
